---
title: Bramble
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, gin]
source: Classic cocktail, number 40 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @gin{2%fl_oz}, @lemon juice{1%fl_oz} and @simple syrup{0.5%fl_oz}. Shake briskly for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #rocks glass{} filled with crushed ice. Drizzle @crème de mûre{0.5%fl_oz} over the top so it bleeds down through the ice. Garnish with @blackberries{2} and a @lemon{1%slice}.

> Created by Dick Bradsell in London in 1984.
